  "notes": [
    "MODEL counterfactuals on one frozen OBS trace. These cases do not change Wishfire gameplay or establish a StoneAge combat formula.",
    "The target is ordinary farming with zero Hero KOs and minimum modeled HP at least 90% of max HP. This is an explicit test-bed threshold, not an approved production balance value.",
    "The wave begins after a full-HP ordinary clear. Its later KO is natural; the earlier forced one-HP recovery is outside the selected interval.",
    "Defense, evasion, drain cadence, and regen values are illustrative knobs. Drain assumes a successful Hero strike every three seconds because the OBS log does not expose all outgoing hits.",
    "Every ordinary-farming case fails immediately on its first Hero KO, including the synthetic high-pressure stress case. No farming KO is a passing control.",
    "S19 onward isolates effective hit mitigation plus passive HP regeneration, the actionable two-knob design space. Evasion, drain, and four-mechanism cases are hypothetical diagnostics only; Wishfire does not have those baseline stats. A mitigation fraction is not a proven mapping from Wishfire DEF points."
  ],
